    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "08. Command Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "08.03",
    "summary": "The active player makes 1 **Battle-shock roll** for each of their units that meets 1 or both of these conditions:\n\n- already **Battle-shocked**\n- down to **half-strength** or less\n\nA unit that was Battle-shocked when the step began stops being Battle-shocked if its roll here succeeds.",
